---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: Project library for Nixon FM.
permalink: /projects/
---

<section id="project-library">
    <h2>Project Library</h2>

    <p>
        This page organizes my technical work into tracks. Each generated project page uses the same
        case-study template and gets its content from one shared data file.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="playlists">
    <h2>Project Tracks</h2>

    {% for project in projects %}
        <project-track>
            <article>
                <p class="eyebrow">{{ project.category }}</p>
                <h3>{{ project.title }}</h3>
                <p>{{ project.summary }}</p>
                <a href="/projects/{{ project.slug }}/">Read case study</a>
            </article>
        </project-track>
    {% endfor %}
</section>

<section id="project-format">
    <h2>Track Notes</h2>

    <p>
        Each generated project page follows a consistent format: problem, contribution, tools,
        constraints, status, and lessons learned.
    </p>
</section>